       <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-2">The script checks each nameserver for each TLD instead of just doing
 a simple query because the nameservers for some of the TLDs have
 inconsistent data in them with respect to the records shown here.</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.a-3">#! /bin/sh
